Restore V24
Run(24,52,8,0,0)
Restore V25
Run(25,52,8,0,3)
Restore V26
Run(26,98,8,0,0)
Restore V27
Run(27,3,8,0,0)
Restore V28
Run(28,49,32,2,0)
PokeI($E1C00008,464)
MmuDisableCachedFlushed()
ProcedureReturn 0
EndProcedure
